  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: ADVANCED LOOT\n\nRarity always takes precedence. Highlighted buttons retain that rarity/type/element.\n\nWeapon Type means the actual weapon class. Weapon Element means its BASE/PRIMARY element, not an affix. These only restrict weapons.\n\nItem Type selects a separate legal modifier policy. Click a modifier to require it. Explicit matches ordinary affixes; Implicit requires the permanent implicit. Minimum Tier accepts that tier or better; Any accepts every tier.\n\nALL requires every selected modifier. If more explicit mods are selected than the item's capacity, its full explicit set must belong to the selected pool. ANY requires Minimum Matches.\n\nAuto-Dismantle ON destroys rejected pickups for whole crafting currencies. OFF retains them. Locked items always survive. Manual right-click dismantling remains available.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
